# f32 rounds after every op. 2^24 = 16777216 is the first f32 whose successor is not representable,
# so 16777216 + 1 rounds back to 16777216 (ties to even), twice. Rounding once at the end would give 16777218.
%big  = cast 16777216 dtype=f32
%a    = add %big 1
%b    = add %a 1
%test = assert %b 16777216
